@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
autonumber

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "Antarmuka Klien\n(Browser UI)" as UI
participant "Server Query / Action\n(getPbgList / markPbgLunas)" as Server
database "PostgreSQL\n(Neon DB)" as DB

== 1. Monitoring Jatuh Tempo H-3 Melalui Antarmuka ==
Admin -> UI: Buka menu /admin/pbg & filter "Jatuh Tempo <= 3 Hari"
activate UI

UI -> Server: getPbgList({status: 'JATUH_TEMPO_3_HARI'})
activate Server

Server -> Server: Hitung tanggal WIB: todayWib s.d. todayWib + 3 hari
Server -> DB: SELECT * FROM pbg WHERE status='BELUM_BAYAR' AND jatuh_tempo >= $1::date AND jatuh_tempo <= $2::date
activate DB
DB --> Server: Daftar baris tagihan retribusi PBG
deactivate DB

Server -> Server: Sensor nomor WhatsApp pemohon (maskWaNumber: 62812****7890)
Server --> UI: Data tagihan tersaring dengan nomor WA tersensor
deactivate Server

UI --> Admin: Tampilkan daftar tagihan PBG mendekati jatuh tempo
deactivate UI

== 2. Penandaan Status Lunas Retribusi PBG ==
Admin -> UI: Pemohon membayar, klik "Tandai Lunas" pada baris tagihan
activate UI

UI -> Server: markPbgLunasAction(id)
activate Server

Server -> DB: SELECT status FROM pbg WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB --> Server: Data status tagihan
deactivate DB

alt Tagihan sudah berstatus LUNAS
  Server --> UI: Error "Tagihan PBG ini sudah berstatus LUNAS"
  UI --> Admin: Peringatan status
else Tagihan berstatus BELUM_BAYAR
  Server -> DB: UPDATE pbg SET status='LUNAS', dibayar_pada=NOW(), updated_at=NOW() WHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB --> Server: Baris tagihan terupdate
  deactivate DB

  Server --> UI: {success: true, message: "Tagihan SKRD ... berhasil ditandai LUNAS"}
  deactivate Server
  UI --> Admin: Toast sukses, badge status berubah hijau (LUNAS), & hilang dari alert jatuh tempo
  deactivate UI
end

note over Admin, DB
  [CATATAN FAKTA REVERSE ENGINEERING]:
  Fitur pengiriman notifikasi WhatsApp otomatis melalui Fonnte Gateway dan cron job /api/cron/pbg-reminder
  DITANGGUHKAN SEMENTARA pada implementasi Fase 4 demi stabilitas data retribusi dan verifikasi domain.
  Tabel 'notifikasi_log' dan 'pengaturan' berstatus [SKEMA SAJA / TIDAK TERHUBUNG].
end note
@enduml

